[{"title":"王舍人路分生辰","author":"释德洪","text":"贵出贤王裔，宗连母后因。\n秋容漱毛骨，春色照簪绅。\n报国忠诚著，惊人句法新。\n惯看青禁月，屡梦玉关尘。\n博古知无敌，穷经亦绝伦。\n后宵通七夕，今日是生辰。\n佳气凌湘浦，非烟压楚闉。\n绿醽浮白蚁，绮席绕花轮。\n寿缀诸天献，词容野客陈。\n不凋蟾窟桂，难老海山春。\n已作瞻双阙，行看据要津。\n功名先入手，图画在麒麟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61585,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阎资钦提举生辰","author":"释德洪","text":"节序春将半，风光过上旬。\n人间识英物，地上见麒麟。\n冻雨晴还暗，非烟夜达晨。\n欢声动湘楚，和气满簪绅。\n孝友疑无比，恢疏亦绝伦。\n一身浑是德，终日不违仁。\n梦已游青禁，行当侍紫宸。\n立朝知大体，博古见全醇。\n诗妙终联鼎，文高类过秦。\n公廉清似玉，刚正凛如神。\n幕下名流集，堂中绮宴陈。\n贯珠歌白雪，浮蚁皱红鳞。\n自幸承颜旧，仍容造膝频。\n何时渡弱水，同看十洲春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61586,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈奉议生辰","author":"释德洪","text":"华国生贤俊，江山孕秀灵。\n鸭头淦水绿，螺髻玉筒青。\n敏捷收科第，奇豪见典刑。\n笑谈回暖律，诗句挟风霆。\n官偶求彭泽，才宜在汉庭。\n麒麟横逆气，鸑鷟敛修翎。\n民讼多閒日，棠阴自满亭。\n浪传书课奏，须看鼎彝铭。\n仲夏逢佳节，非烟聚杳冥。\n数蓂馀一叶，推道间千龄。\n阡陌登丰后，笙歌烂熳听。\n绮筵环妙丽，寿斝捧娉婷。\n欢洽连更烛，情高促画屏。\n九衢花照夜，万井月开扃。\n风飐银河动，天惊玉露零。\n三台星密处，旁有老人星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61587,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵曾伯容哭夏均父","author":"释德洪","text":"青松傲霜雪，事误亦迍邅。\n或脱斧斤厄，则遭藤蔓缠。\n北渠材砢礧，耸壑色芳鲜。\n不作千楹栋，终为万斛船。\n那知过华屋，长恸摇空鞭。\n增击疑仙去，超摇弃我先。\n但馀殷枕泪，无复对床眠。\n忆昨游湓浦，曾同上紫烟。\n春光随杖履，笑响落云泉。\n尚想登临处，仍哦唱和篇。\n暗惊生死隔，默数十三年。\n台宪登群彦，秋风吹一鹯。\n诛奸志未舍，谋国疏空传。\n醉驭毛车度，谁推日毂旋。\n岁时嗟易得，力命古难全。\n报施徒云尔，功名信偶然。\n清忠光竹帛，英气敛山川。\n哭子如临敌，当勾失短鋋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61588,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湘上閒居","author":"释德洪","text":"夜清暑雨过，四壁草虫鸣。\n一枕幽人梦，半窗閒月明。\n摧颓宏法志，老大住山情。\n忽忆陈尊宿，编蒲度此生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61589,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西斋昼卧","author":"释德洪","text":"馀生已无累，古寺寄闲房。\n睡足无来客，窗空又夕阳。\n丛蕉高出屋，病叶偶飘廊。\n起探风檐立，飞蚊闹晚凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61590,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋夕示超然","author":"释德洪","text":"夜色已可掬，林光翻欲流。\n一钩窥隙月，数叶搅眠秋。\n清境扶归梦，残缸替客愁。\n搜诗时画席，忽觉此生浮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61591,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早春","author":"释德洪","text":"山中春尚浅，风物丽烟光。\n涧草殷勤绿，岩花造次香。\n浮根争附络，细叶正商量。\n好在幽兰径，无人亦自芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61592,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧还长沙","author":"释德洪","text":"去袂不容挽，子规真滑唇。\n烟村相送处，风物更撩人。\n麦浪空翻日，花房尚锁春。\n遥知到湘浦，卢橘恰尝新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61593,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵真觉大师瑞香花","author":"释德洪","text":"浅色闹花堂，清寒熏夜香。\n应持燕尾剪，破此麝脐囊。\n有恨成春睡，无人见洗妆。\n故山烟雨里，寂寞为谁芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61594,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵谊叟悼性上人","author":"释德洪","text":"井美泉先竭，犀残角有通。\n斯人难再得，陈迹已成空。\n麈尾梦应寄，楞伽写未终。\n平生说禅口，不见怒号风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61595,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夕和津汝楫","author":"释德洪","text":"今夕亦常夕，人偏故国思。\n不堪搓冻耳，听诵未归诗。\n家室谊哗后，深檐雨雪时。\n炉香待清旦，此意有谁知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61596,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"启明轩次朗上人韵","author":"释德洪","text":"澄滓动精色，开轩万象分。\n光无回避处，眼自覆藏君。\n霞缕萦经轴，烟丝减篆文。\n个中无膡语，题目是先闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61597,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"回光轩","author":"释德洪","text":"暮色眩红碧，登临聊倚栏。\n日终犹返照，坐稳可深观。\n梦幻诸缘寂，圆明一颗寒。\n洞然无向背，莫作转头看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61598,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵黄元明","author":"释德洪","text":"静室依清几，开书映隙光。\n悟迷初不隔，语默故难藏。\n妙可忘情会，深无以意量。\n临机辨神骏，正要略玄黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61599,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓钟山","author":"释德洪","text":"生涯如倦鸟，栖息此山中。\n睡足谁呼觉，烟消篆已空。\n翻经欺眼力，斜日借窗红。\n卧听铜瓶泣，青松万壑风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61600,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读中观论","author":"释德洪","text":"平生智眼浊，尘劫著心深。\n长向环轮上，空将始末寻。\n十方真寂灭，一念去来今。\n妙绝调琴指，知谁解赏音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61601,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"对雪尝水饼","author":"释德洪","text":"雪粲罗敷喜，报春呈舞腰。\n旋风寒正密，到地暖还消。\n轻薄凌梅蕊，蹁跹搅柳条。\n幽欣尝水饼，举箸一长谣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61602,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清明前一日闻杜宇示清道芬","author":"释德洪","text":"篱外花如海，閒轩小寝惊。\n最先闻杜宇，更觉近清明。\n云怒必为雨，风和拗得晴。\n阿芬甘劣我，笑里恰诗成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61603,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒门","author":"释德洪","text":"杯饭终永日，一裘支千秋。\n馀生已无累，此外复何求。\n懒出门常闭，欣眠榻可休。\n抛书方手倦，啼鸟破深幽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61604,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四月十一日书壁","author":"释德洪","text":"夜久茅斋静，阶泉绕佩鸣。\n行高人莫识，道远自深明。\n扫榻酬闲味，依蒲任性情。\n丛林终不负，一衲傲平生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61605,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵云庵老人题妙用轩","author":"释德洪","text":"开轩閒隐几，万象竞趋陪。\n风揭松声去，云推山色来。\n观身真作梦，视世一浮埃。\n日暮庭阴转，幽禽接趐回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61606,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读瑜伽论","author":"释德洪","text":"此生已无累，一席可穷年。\n细嚼宝公饭，饱参弥勒禅。\n懒修精进定，爱作吉祥眠。\n夜久山空寂，唯闻绕砌泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61607,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钟山有花如比丘状出秾叶间王文公名为罗汉花僧请赋诗","author":"释德洪","text":"通力元无碍，随缘自应真。\n此生花上露，故现叶间身。\n知见幽香在，伽梨翠色新。\n一枝聊把玩，未愧鹫峰人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61608,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题行林寺照堂","author":"释德洪","text":"闻说行林寺，杳然丛秀间。\n堂清开水镜，山好理烟鬟。\n有雾窗呵暗，无尘扉自关。\n人牛今不见，蓑苙两俱闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61609,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与性之","author":"释德洪","text":"物外不可必，相看一笑休。\n好山终入手，堕甑懒回头。\n知复何时见，聊为此日留。\n定难瞒道眼，得丧两浮沤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61610,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"僧求晓披晚清二轩诗二首 其一","author":"释德洪","text":"披衣汲南涧，落叶在庭除。\n独立无人见，幽行偏自如。\n嫩寒冰齿颊，精色到衣裾。\n却倚蒲轮坐，横看贝叶书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61611,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"僧求晓披晚清二轩诗二首 其二","author":"释德洪","text":"旋螺堆空青，重叠不容数。\n夕阳穿贯之，浓薄自呈露。\n数点没烟鸿，一声伐云斧。\n殷床钟未消，流萤自开户。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61612,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日溪行","author":"释德洪","text":"侧布宝坊地，白沙杨柳湾。\n忆曾婴死祸，不自意生还。\n已觉无乡梦，今真是故山。\n溪花眠雾雨，春在有无间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61613,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧归故庐","author":"释德洪","text":"投名新入社，卧病偶思归。\n渡涧脱芒屦，扶藤下翠微。\n寒松犹带雨，瘦骨不胜衣。\n若见翁钻纸，当施百丈机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61614,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"焦山赠僧二首 其一","author":"释德洪","text":"白下门连寺，清游入梦中。\n骨惊谁齧指，世事谩书空。\n梵行芙蕖净，天寒昼火红。\n晓窗应破梦，卧听鸟呼风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61615,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"焦山赠僧二首 其二","author":"释德洪","text":"对床听夜雨，佳约是当年。\n放旷随缘去，闲心不习禅。\n倚蒲趺足坐，拥衲盖头眠。\n今识君归处，斋馀有涧泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61616,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题反身轩","author":"释德洪","text":"尽力觅不得，归来题反身。\n平生未解没，宁解救滔人。\n有累路岐远，无求滋味亲。\n养心唯寡欲，妙物久如神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61617,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿本觉寺","author":"释德洪","text":"一宿路旁寺，霜清梦亦寒。\n忆曾游览处，来觅旧题看。\n病衲成新塔，层楼隐败垣。\n青山犹不老，千叠似翔鸾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61618,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题芝轩","author":"释德洪","text":"轩下亦何有，灵芝骈秀生。\n山川呈美瑞，草木被光荣。\n清甚紫檀露，色深黄菊英。\n武陵续遗事，应著此轩名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61619,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵王安道节推过云盖","author":"释德洪","text":"秀杰长沙幕，高才自敏强。\n同僚推俊逸，黼坐畏刚方。\n惯吐珠玑句，宜便宴寝香。\n秋来能过我，听雨夜连床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61620,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题含容室","author":"释德洪","text":"敛足脱双履，闲房倚瘦藤。\n百川朝巨浸，一室纳千灯。\n至味宁分别，常光绝减增。\n刹尘彰帝网，妙观现层层。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61621,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人日雪二首 其一","author":"释德洪","text":"今年人日雪，更在末山岩。\n泻行想堆垛，打窗时两三。\n梦回清语默，寒重压衣衫。\n面壁孤风坐，知谁继夜参。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61622,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人日雪二首 其二","author":"释德洪","text":"律管未回暖，春先到晓岩。\n与君清作对，得月便成三。\n秀色报虚幌，幽欣宜衲衫。\n相看超语默，觌露不须参。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61623,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵周运句见寄","author":"释德洪","text":"顽钝世推鄙，而君偏切磋。\n借神观有漏，骑气到无何。\n昔共饮临汝，今同家汩罗。\n衡门似长吉，轩盖几时过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61624,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重会云叟禅师","author":"释德洪","text":"气味似前辈，见之长眼明。\n闲须研法味，老不减诗情。\n草圣因蛇斗，禅枝解虎争。\n一堂聊寄傲，疏快饯馀生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61625,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次忠子韵二首 其一","author":"释德洪","text":"湘云刺世眼，独可著闲踪。\n鸥迥千寻雨，江寒一再风。\n旋钻新火后，初脱夹衣重。\n坐客经年别，兰芽茁旧丛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61626,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次忠子韵二首 其二","author":"释德洪","text":"新秧翻翠浪，青子退红英。\n穫麦风光近，络丝欢笑声。\n瞢腾幽梦破，酝造小诗成。\n好在归来燕，营巢占画楹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61627,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和曾逢原待制观雪","author":"释德洪","text":"魂清寒妥贴，寺近汨罗江。\n夜迥疑生月，梦惊闻打窗。\n地垆无宿火，经阁有残缸。\n起望兜绵界，谁推堕陋邦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61628,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初过海自号甘露灭","author":"释德洪","text":"本是甘露灭，浪名无垢称。\n欲知遭锁禁，正坐忽规绳。\n海上垂须佛，军中有发僧。\n生涯何所似，崖略类腾腾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61629,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早登澄迈西四十里宿临皋亭补东坡遗","author":"释德洪","text":"天下至穷处，风烟触地愁。\n村嚣闻捉拗，岸汁忽西流。\n鸟道通儋耳，鲸波隔万州。\n趁鸡行落月，悽断在蛮讴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61630,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过淩水县","author":"释德洪","text":"野径如遗索，萦纡到县门。\n犁人趁牛日，蜑户聚鱼村。\n篱落春潮退，桑麻晓瘴昏。\n题诗惊万里，折意一消魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61631,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨文中将北渡何武翼出妓作会文中清狂不喜武人径饮三杯不揖坐客上马驰去索诗送行作此","author":"释德洪","text":"兰丛聚贵客，花轮环侍儿。\n三杯吾径醉，四座汝为谁。\n但觉眩红碧，了不闻歌吹。\n翩然上马去，海月解相随。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61632,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渡海","author":"释德洪","text":"万里来偿债，三年堕瘴乡。\n逃禅解羊负，破律醉槟榔。\n瘦尽声音在，病残须鬓荒。\n馀生实天幸，今日上归艎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61633,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐分题得廊字","author":"释德洪","text":"一雨饯残暑，瘴痾苏簟凉。\n卧闻山果落，起觉斛兰香。\n幌内水萤入，阶除露叶光。\n知谁爱清境，步屧响修廊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61634,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出狱李生来谒出百丈汾阳二像为示因而摹之作此时即欲还谷山","author":"释德洪","text":"一钵寄城市，皤然须鬓长。\n风埃穷百丈，翰墨老汾阳。\n家在青松岸，门连白鸟行。\n知谁施舟尾，载我下沅湘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61635,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵周倅大雪见寄二首 其一","author":"释德洪","text":"万瓦粲清晓，披衣挂北窗。\n春先归楚国，谁独钓湘江。\n瘴熟甘欺得，诗严合受降。\n更怜风絮比，想见髻鬟双。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61636,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵周倅大雪见寄二首 其二","author":"释德洪","text":"白昼通红火，萧萧惊打窗。\n折绵寒未透，兀梦睡先降。\n那敢犯诗垒，自然摧慢幢。\n重看寄来句，呵手剔残缸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61637,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵郤子中学句出巡","author":"释德洪","text":"安石性夷粹，公今亦重迟。\n追惟理发处，领略办装时。\n高节贯终始，寸田齐坦巇。\n功名恐未免，才业系安危。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61638,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵邓公阁睡起","author":"释德洪","text":"归计宽为约，山行短作程。\n旅亭惊午梦，布谷正催耕。\n翰墨堪华国，云泉负此生。\n一篇叙闲适，细味有馀情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61639,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵衡山道中","author":"释德洪","text":"岳色堕马首，岚光忽满襟。\n眼寒知意适，句苦觉愁侵。\n沃野献新绿，残睛酿晚阴。\n天涯惊去雁，料理欲归心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61640,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠邹颜徒","author":"释德洪","text":"肉眼倒皮相，高才多陆沉。\n火知三日玉，贫试一生心。\n世路多追逐，云山独见寻。\n圣贤酌古力，劝子手勤斟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61641,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"投老庵读云庵旧题拜次其韵二首 其一","author":"释德洪","text":"但觉意清净，不知山浅深。\n年华暗凋落，老境已侵寻。\n三世楼钟旧，一生香火心。\n高风难补缀，永愧壁间吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61642,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"投老庵读云庵旧题拜次其韵二首 其二","author":"释德洪","text":"道乡归路晚，世迹陷泥深。\n老死先通耗，病衰今见寻。\n规模高世意，料理住山心。\n月在孤峰顶，冻猿时一吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61643,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熏上人归云溪","author":"释德洪","text":"闻道衡峰北，寺当猿叫村。\n夜楼千嶂月，书榻一溪云。\n我惯蹈忧患，君方蜕垢纷。\n莫嫌林下石，藓涴褶衣裙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61644,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题使台后圃八首 其一 谛观室","author":"释德洪","text":"优入圣贤域，湛然观道真。\n一身浑是德，终日不违仁。\n深静啼林鸟，虚明见隙尘。\n篆畦凝碧缕，红烬白灰新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61645,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题使台后圃八首 其二 赏趣堂","author":"释德洪","text":"胸次有丘壑，笑谈无俗氛。\n幽怀常自得，佳趣与谁论。\n曳履寻花圃，扶筇卓藓痕。\n地严宾谒少，却坐看垆熏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61646,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题使台后圃八首 其三 会心堂","author":"释德洪","text":"称意有余乐，幽欢常会心。\n小山供赋咏，危榭每登临。\n下视千峰月，聊挥一弄琴。\n尚嫌闲适少，富贵苦相寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61647,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题使台后圃八首 其四 阜安堂","author":"释德洪","text":"礼义成风俗，丰登民阜安。\n此堂共僚属，把酒听吹弹。\n地富湖山美，宵晴风月寒。\n胜游无俗韵，意适有余欢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61648,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题使台后圃八首 其五 戏綵堂","author":"释德洪","text":"承颜忘势位，喜惧两迟回。\n堂上綵衣舞，樽前笑靥开。\n金镮应学探，竹马欲相陪。\n未必称纯孝，高风独老莱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61649,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题使台后圃八首 其六 独秀堂","author":"释德洪","text":"天质自奇峻，千寻紫翠重。\n谩烦君独秀，不愿掩群峰。\n与客共秋晚，搜诗到暮钟。\n夕阴寒欲滴，倚槛见纤秾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61650,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]